# Qualcomm Wayland dependencies

The native Qualcomm GBM and EGL drivers still link against the old Wayland
libraries, even though raylib uses DRM directly and Weston is no longer shipped.
Keep libwayland 1.9.0-1 and its libffi6 dependency until those drivers are replaced.

Rebuild libwayland-1.9.0-1.deb with build-libwayland-deb.sh.
The libffi6 package comes from Ubuntu Xenial; its armhf counterpart is in libs32.
